  "ruleText": "PART Saf-C 4205 Reserved\n\nSource. #7348, eff 8-22-00; amd by #8150, eff 8-30-04; paragraphs (a), (c), & (d) EXPIRED: 8-22-08; amd by #9375, eff 1-30-09 (paragraph (b) deleted)\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule | Statute\n\nSaf-C 4201.01 | RSA 146-A:11-a; RSA 260:38, IV\n\nSaf-C 4202.01-4202.04 | RSA 260:38, IV; RSA 21-P:6; RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 4202.05 | RSA 294-E:2, V\n\nSaf-C 4202.06 | RSA 294-E:2, VII\n\nSaf-C 4202.07 | RSA 294-E:2, VIII\n\nSaf-C 4202.08 | RSA 146-A:11-b, II; RSA 260:38, IV: RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 4202.09 | RSA 146-A:11-b, II\n\nSaf-C 4202.10 | RSA 146-A:11-b, I(c)\n\nSaf-C 4202.11-4202.12 | RSA 146-A:11-b, IV\n\nSaf-C 4202.13-4202.15 | RSA 260:38, VI; RSA 146-A:11-b, I(b); RSA 146-A:11-c; RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 4203.01 | RSA 146-A:11-b\n\nSaf-C 4203.02 | RSA 146-A:11-b; RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 4203.03-4203.04 | RSA 260:38; RSA 146-A:11-b, II & IV\n\nSaf-C 4203.05-4203.06 | RSA 260:38; RSA 260:45; RSA 250:54-a\n\nSaf-C 4203.07 | RSA 260:6; RSA 260:44; RSA 541-A:30-a\n\nSaf-C 4204.01 | RSA 146-A:11-b, II & IV; RSA 260:38, IV; RSA 541-A:19-b\n\nSaf-C 4204.02 | RSA 260:38, I; RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 4204.03 | RSA 146-A:11-b, IV\n\nSaf-C 4204.04 | RSA 146-A:11-b, IV; RSA 146-D:5\n\nSaf-C 4204.05 | RSA 260:38, IV; RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 4204.06 | RSA 6:11-a; RSA 260:38, IV\n\nSaf-C 4204.07 | RSA 260:38; RSA 260:44",
